# OpenClaw hermes-memory-review-agent cron entries.
# Cron is UTC. Two schedules, one wrapper:
#   - weekly review: Sunday 06:00 UTC. The wrapper enforces the 24h manual-run
#     suppression gate before invoking the LLM agent.
#   - hourly memory-ping: every hour at minute :20 (deterministic, no LLM).
#     Offset to :20 so it never coincides with the Sunday 06:00 weekly tick; a
#     shared lock guards any residual overlap.
#
# Deployed to: /etc/cron.d/openclaw-hermes-memory-review (root:root, mode 644).
0 6 * * 0 openclaw /home/openclaw/.openclaw/scripts/hermes-memory-review-cron.sh --weekly   # UTC
20 * * * * openclaw /home/openclaw/.openclaw/scripts/hermes-memory-review-cron.sh --hourly  # UTC
